  "body": "Imagine waking up to the sound of waves and panoramic views of Rangitoto - this north-facing beachfront apartment in the heart of Takapuna offers the perfect blend of luxury, security, and convenience.\r\n \r\nDesigned for effortless living, this spacious residence features two double bedrooms, including a master with an ensuite, plus a second full bathroom. Sliding doors flood the open-plan living area with natural light, while the private balcony provides the perfect spot to soak in the stunning Gulf views.\r\n \r\nBeyond your front door, enjoy resort-style amenities including a swimming pool and a fully equipped gym plus an in house library. A dedicated onsite building manager ensures peace of mind, and with two adjacent secure garage car parks , convenience is at your doorstep.\r\n \r\nLocated just moments from Takapuna's vibrant shopping, dining, and entertainment scene, this lock-up-and-leave home offers the best of both worlds-beachside tranquillity with city convenience.\r\n \r\nApartments in this premium location are in high demand-don't miss your chance. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing!",
